    "created_at": "2022-05-24T20:06:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-24T20:06:58Z",
    "body": "You can't get the size without reading it in?  What about getSize()? \r\nWhat's the usecase for these with regards to OPFS?   (I can see perhaps being more relevant for the File System api, but I'm not so sure they're needed for OPFS). That said, these obviously could be supported if needed, but each added API/feature adds complexity.\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
