    "updated_at": "2022-05-31T13:24:39Z",
    "body": "With SyncAccessHandle, you can call getSize() without creating a blob or reading it into memory.   If we added a lastModified(), that would cover some of what you want.   MimeType... while we could add the concept of a MimeType to OPFS files (though this might require some type of DB use -- chrome and Firefox are already using one; not sure about Apple), underlying filesystems don't necessarily have the concept as part of their metadata.   I would lean against such a proposal.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
