    "body": "Let's keep this issue scoped to metadata that is typically exposed across various file systems. (It seems reasonable to file an issue to consider exposing sniffing, but that's a fair bit of work and given that we don't necessarily want to extend it beyond what we need for the web it's unclear if that's a good pattern here.)",
