    "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:46:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-27T22:46:21Z",
    "body": "To summarize: \n\nA way to both read and write this would be useful for **both** files and folders.\n\n- **Access timestamp (atime)**: which indicates the last time a file was accessed.\n- **Modified timestamp (mtime)**: which is the last time a file's contents were modified.\n- **Change timestamp (ctime)**: which refers to the last time some metadata related to the file was changed.\n\nAnd as mention already:\n- additionally, a way to get file size without using `syncAccessHandle` or `getFile()` would be useful.\n- and a way to count number of items in a folder",
    "author_association": "NONE",
